<title>UK: TABLE - Helical profits jump 30 percent.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Helical profits jump 30 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>14 months to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 31.6		  vs 29.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   4.85		 vs  4.40</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)   8.0		  vs  7.3</p>
<p> Pretax			12.03		 vs  9.20</p>
<p> Turnover		   100.53		 vs 65.95</p>
<p>NOTE - The group also declared a special dividend of 2.0 pence a share to compensate shareholders for the extra two months in the accounting period.</p>
<p>Full name of property investment group is Helical Bar Plc .</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
